  "details": "When you preload a world, you'll get a notification when it's done preloading. Sometimes when switching instances the notification will become glitched, you can see the world name but it'll have a completely black thumbnail and neither of the buttons work so you can dismiss it or view the world info.\n\nIt seems to be completely random when it happens so I have no idea how to consistently replicate this bug. If you preload a bunch of worlds and then switch to a different one, chances are you might end up with at least 1 or 2 broken preload notifications.",
